---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout 
  title="Introduction — Aster Design System"
  description="Aster Design System is a token-first, zero-dependency design system designed to provide one authoritative source of truth with dual human and agent interfaces."
  currentPath="/docs"
>
  <article class="doc-view" id="view-introduction" data-title="Introduction" data-section="docs" aria-labelledby="t-introduction">
    <header class="page-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Getting Started</div>
      <h1 id="t-introduction" tabindex="-1">Introduction</h1>
      <p class="lead">Aster DS is a token-first, zero-dependency design system engineered to deliver a single authoritative source of truth with dual interfaces for developers and AI coding agents.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="doc-body">
      <!-- Dual Interfaces -->
      <section class="doc-section">
        <h2>Dual Human &amp; Agent Interfaces</h2>
        <p>Unlike traditional design systems built exclusively for human engineers, Aster provides paired human and agent documentation:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--doc-ink, #0f0f0f); font-size: 14.5px;">
          <li><strong>Human-Facing Interface:</strong> Interactive documentation, component playgrounds, and zero-framework HTML/CSS patterns in <code>docs/</code>, <code>components/</code>, and <code>apps/docs/</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Agent-Facing Interface:</strong> Machine-readable design tokens, component contracts, and structured coding skills in <code>AGENTS.md</code> and <code>skills/</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Canonical Source of Truth -->
      <section class="doc-section">
        <h2>Canonical Source of Truth</h2>
        <p>Aster enforces strict unidirectional compilation from source files to distribution outputs:</p>
        <div style="background: var(--as-semantic-color-surface-card); border: 1px solid var(--as-semantic-color-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--as-radius-md); padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
          <div><strong>&bull; Design Tokens Source:</strong> <code>tokens/**/*.json</code> (W3C DTCG format)</div>
          <div><strong>&bull; Component Source:</strong> <code>components/&lt;component&gt;/*.&#123;js,css&#125;</code> and <code>components/base/base.css</code></div>
          <div><strong>&bull; Distribution Outputs:</strong> <code>dist/css/tokens.css</code>, <code>dist/css/components.css</code>, <code>dist/css/aster.css</code>, and <code>dist/js/aster.js</code></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Navigation footer -->
      <nav class="doc-pagination" aria-label="Documentation Pagination" style="margin-top: 48px;">
        <span class="doc-pagination__placeholder"></span>
        <a href="/docs/installation" class="doc-pagination__link doc-pagination__link--next" rel="next">
          <span class="doc-pagination__dir">Next <svg class="as-icon" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span>
          <span class="doc-pagination__title">Installation &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
